      "statement": "The /openwiki/reference/agent-execution.md page serves as a redirect to the primary Agent Execution documentation, which provides comprehensive coverage of the agent's structured, state-driven loop orchestrated by a LangGraph StateGraph, including initialization, model invocation, tool dispatch, result processing, termination logic, middleware hooks, and structured output handling.",
