      "id": "claim_04b1a1a08c344d3cbb45e368f9226955",
      "statement": "The agent state extends AgentState TypedDict with required 'messages' field (reduced via add_messages), optional 'structured_response' field (omitted from input schema, included in output), and ephemeral 'jump_to' field for middleware flow control. Middleware can extend the schema by defining state_schema; all schemas merge during agent creation with explicit state_schema winning conflicts.",
