      "statement": "ModelRequest encapsulates all information for model invocation: model instance, messages, system_message, tools list, response_format, state, runtime context, and model_settings. Middleware uses immutable override() to create modified requests. ModelResponse contains result messages and optional structured_response; ExtendedModelResponse adds an optional Command for additional state updates.",
