      "id": "claim_cafe47b6906146f5a64e06df95e1260b",
      "statement": "Middleware hooks compose by registration order (first = outermost): before_agent/before_model chain forward, after_model/after_agent chain backward. wrap_model_call and wrap_tool_call handlers are composed into single middleware stacks with inner-first command accumulation. Each middleware instance is validated for uniqueness and can define state_schema extension, tools, transformers, and trace_policy.",
