      "id": "claim_a7883ecaf5de4844b49f99b6d2746863",
      "statement": "Model invocation prepares a ModelRequest, applies wrap_model_call middleware composition, binds tools and response_format to the model (with auto-detection for provider vs tool strategy), invokes the model, and processes output: for ProviderStrategy parses structured response directly; for ToolStrategy checks for structured output tool calls; handles structured output validation with retryable errors; patches invalid tool calls before next iteration.",
