    {
      "id": "claim_0414d96f92fe4c2ba71c41cfa457711d",
      "statement": "Conditional edges decide routing: model_to_tools checks for explicit jump_to, structured_response completion, pending tool calls, or synthetic tool messages to route to tools or end; tools_to_model checks return_direct on all executed tools or structured output tool execution to exit, otherwise loops back; model_to_model (with structured output only) checks jump_to or structured_response to route. Middleware before_model and after_model hooks can set jump_to to override defaults.",
