    {
      "id": "claim_1a1ab2cd977c45eaa4ea3dd8fc8237f0",
      "statement": "Structured output via response_format uses ProviderStrategy for native model support (e.g., OpenAI response_format) or ToolStrategy for tool-call-based output. Auto-detection wraps raw schemas in AutoStrategy and detects best strategy at runtime based on model capabilities. Tool-based structured output creates OutputToolBinding instances; validation failures trigger error handling that retries if configured, else raises StructuredOutputValidationError.",
