    {
      "id": "claim_ef6da7bbe51b472d9c6675f2f414a157",
      "statement": "Tool execution runs when pending tool calls exist after model invocation. Tools are looked up in ToolNode, middleware wrap_tool_call handlers compose to create a wrapper stack (first = outermost), and each tool executes. Tools node returns ToolMessage or Command. Routing then checks return_direct and structured output completion to decide looping back or exiting.",
