    {
      "id": "claim_7a0c9f03430f459f8ddadad3c97a6dec",
      "statement": "The compiled graph includes model and optional tools nodes, middleware nodes (one per hook per middleware), START and END nodes. Conditional edges route model to tools/exit based on pending calls and structured output; tools to model/exit based on return_direct. before_agent runs once at start, loop repeats between before_model and after_model (or model if no hooks), after_agent runs once at end. Recursion limit is 9,999.",
