      "id": "claim_e0046657282a430d99427f66f99835c9",
      "statement": "The agent supports sync and async execution: sync uses model_node and sync middleware hooks (before_agent, after_model, etc.), async uses amodel_node and async hooks. The framework auto-selects based on which hooks are implemented; mixing sync-only with async invocation raises NotImplementedError with guidance. With no tools, the graph consists of model node and exit only.",
